After several major gameplay and system updates, as well as improved features, we plan to release the official version of "Cultivation Tales" on the Steam platform on April 18, 2024.

As the official version goes online, we will also prepare a massive number of welfare activities for everyone at the same time, including limited titles, rare fashion, appearance treasure chests, game resources, etc., all of which are available upon login! There are also generous rewards waiting for everyone to participate in the activity, such as the opening order, pass upgrade cards, and more!
At the same time, the official version of "Cultivation Tales" will start offering a first release discount, with a limited time discount of 40% off. Purchasing the game only costs 27 yuan! The initial discount will be available from April 18th to May 2nd, for a period of 14 days.
Users who purchase the game and create characters before the official version is launched will receive a total reward of 160 spirit stones through the activity: including 40 spirit stones, 1 pass upgrade card, 2 Qingyun Misty Rain Treasure Chests, and 5 full server speakers.

During the two years of the Tales Pioneer Experience Edition, we have made many new gameplay and system additions and expansions. 17 different systems and gameplay have been added, with 2 new areas for exploring large maps and 3 challenging large bosses. 47 updates and iterations have been completed, and we are pleased to show you some of the content:
Add the function of inheriting and using magic weapons;
Add a new talisman system;
Add a spirit pet system;
Add battlefield gameplay;
Added maps of Endless Sea and Penglai Island Thunder Formation;
Add new types of weapons and treasures;
Add a new underwater abyss dungeon;
Add fishing gameplay;
Add Boss Battlefield;
Newly added hot spring bathing system;
Add mysterious merchant gameplay;
Add air combat systems;
Add Endless Sea Beast Boss and Thunder Array Guardian Boss;
Add the function of sharing the big world with 30 people;
Newly added season pass system;
Add equipment reinforcement system;
Newly added spirit system;
Newly added cross season inheritance system San Sheng Shi;
Add new arena gameplay;
You can experience all of our gameplay content in the official version, and the brand new Tales awaits your exploration!
Players who have purchased the preemptive experience version of "Cultivation Tales" can obtain all the content through free updates on the same day.
Transforming into an immortal and ascending to the Heavenly Gate, wandering freely in the wilderness.
Thank you once again for your support. If you have any further suggestions or opinions on "Cultivation Tales", please feel free to leave us a message~

[h2]Game Introduction[/h2]
"Cultivation Tales" is an open world sandbox cultivation game where players wake up alone in the Four Symbols Formation and find themselves in a chaotic land filled with exotic beasts. You are unarmed and must learn to build tools, acquire resources, make equipment, and establish a sect with fellow Taoists to establish a foothold on this continent. At the same time, absorb spiritual energy to study immortal methods, enhance self abilities, challenge various powerful exotic beasts, and gradually explore this mysterious ancient land.
In the Tales Kyushu Continent, you can:
[b]【 Immortal Cultivation 】[/b] Starting from mortals, one can embark on the path of cultivating immortality through flying swords, magical treasures, spiritual herbs, alchemy, meditation, Dharma protection, crossing tribulations, spiritual roots, immortal relationships, and collecting demons.
16000000m ² A seamless map, starting from the vast wilderness of the barren desert, Kunlun Snow Mountain, oasis, endless sea, and the Great Wall connecting the entire Kyushu continent. Explore the continent to the fullest, challenge the secret realm, defeat the lord, collect resources, open the treasure chest left by predecessors, obtain secrets, elevate the realm, and gradually become a powerful force.
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39619490/c3cfc530c85441171f04528512bbe6974b7b34a8.png[/img]
[b]【 Construction 】[/b] Logging, mining, gathering, killing monsters, and obtaining various materials. Use your hands, forging table, textile table, grinding table, paper rack, workbench, etc. to make increasingly complex and powerful equipment, weapons, pills, etc. Build bricks and tiles, build houses, use construction hammers and tool hammers to build your defense facilities, deploy and build magnificent and powerful sects!
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39619490/d06ad63f561531cac3aca3797a222a31b0e1df9a.jpg[/img]
[b]【 Combat 】[/b]Rich weapons, abundant equipment, powerful treasures, changing spells, rare stones, experience the ever-changing combat system. Explore the world using lightness skills, swordsmanship, stepping on waves, swimming, and turtle breathing techniques, and engage in battles with fierce beasts and other players. Master the true art of combat, make reasonable use of physical strength and magic, dodge, block, and counterattack, and become the most powerful cultivator on the continent!
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39619490/90dc0f67f91954a0f674759ddd4ea4f205f30551.jpg[/img]
More rich and exciting gameplay content, waiting for everyone to enter the Tales experience!

Traveling through the wilderness not only allows you to experience the authentic cultivation content, such as alchemy, weapon refining, spells, treasures, swordsmanship, crossing tribulations, spiritual pets, monsters, secret realms, treasure hunting, etc., step by step from ordinary people to immortal powers;
You can also experience various systems and gameplay of classic sandbox games, collect, build, survive, build, and freely build houses and other buildings, and build your own sect with friends. The high degree of freedom and playability allows every player to do their best to create self satisfying fun in the wilderness.

In order to bring better game experience to Tao friends, "Too wild Beginning" will be stopped from 12:00 on August 8 to August 10 for maintenance, please prepare in advance!

=== Maintenance time ===
August 8 12:00 to August 10 15:00
The end time of maintenance may be delayed according to the actual maintenance progress

===S6 season starts ===
The S5 season will end at 12:00 on August 8, 2023, when this season's honor points will be settled, and the new season S6 will start after this version update

=== New content ===
1. New shared world in PVP mode:
Support 30 people to play on the same screen; After the capture of the position, the clan supplies collection doubled. (After the interactive battle drum, select Assembly, and then select Share Big World to go)

2. New season pass system:
Ordinary pass is free to unlock, ordinary pass can get aster demon feather skin for men and women;
The advanced pass price is 38 yuan, and the advanced pass can obtain a set of Qingxi Huansha skin for men and women, Rainbow single sword skin, Canglongyin title, etc.
3. New recruitment function in Friends Square:
In the dating square interactive recruitment of the elderly can view the recruitment announcement, or apply to join the door. Recruitment announcements can be modified on the announcements page of the community;
4. Add weekly ranking, settle every week, and get rewards according to the ranking.

=== Adjust and optimize content ===
1. Adjust the entry conditions of the secret area:
If the level does not meet the requirements of the secret environment, you cannot enter the corresponding level of the secret environment, which can be seen on the in-game secret environment page;
2. Optimize new tasks and increase subsequent tasks;
3. Store draw new minimum guarantee mechanism:
50 draws must be a skin, and the guaranteed reward does not repeat. If you already have all the skin in the gift bag, repeated acquisition will be converted into crushed jade;
4. Opening Order adjustment:
Because the game recharge channel is closed, can not buy the spirit stone, Kaizong order sales mode changed to direct purchase
The purchase of open order reward content is adjusted to [season open privilege], [Master title], Character name change card], [door name change card], [Backpack expansion card], [full service horn]x10;
5. Change of use method of transfer order:
The transfer order is used in the new household and can still be used after the old household is deleted;
6. Increase the protection period of new Zongmen (5 days), which is displayed in the form of a drum character in the game;
7. The mall added a new architectural skin "Imperial City";
8. Some products are removed from the store.
